                                "sense_id": "48220f66-b045-3c64-96ff-710530b94a9d",
                                "text": "De marine beschikt over verschillende oorlogsbodems om de nationale veiligheid te waarborgen.",
                                "translation": "The navy has several warships to ensure national security.",
                                "english": "The navy has several warships to ensure national security."
