                                "sense_id": "48220f66-b045-3c64-96ff-710530b94a9d",
                                "text": "De moderne oorlogsbodem is uitgerust met geavanceerde technologieën en wapensystemen.",
                                "translation": "The modern warship is equipped with advanced technologies and weapon systems.",
                                "english": "The modern warship is equipped with advanced technologies and weapon systems."
                            },
                            {
